OL,3,AImmigration agents search congresswoman
OL,4,AIlhan Omar's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS immigration agents have searched the
OL,7,Fhome of Minnesota Representative Ilhan
OL,8,FOmar as part of a criminal
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FHomeland Security Investigations (HSI)
OL,12,Fagents "executed a judicially
OL,13,Fauthorised search warrant" for the
OL,14,Fproperty in the Washington DC area, a
OL,15,FUS justice department spokesperson
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
