OL,3,AImmigration agents search congresswoman
OL,4,AIlhan Omar's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe search "is part of an ongoing
OL,7,Ffederal criminal investigation", the
OL,8,Fspokesperson said, but no further
OL,9,Fdetails were given. The US Congress is
OL,10,Fcurrently out of session and it is
OL,11,Funclear if Omar was at the home.
OL,13,FOmar, a Democrat and outspoken critic
OL,14,Fof President Donald Trump, described
OL,15,Fthe search on social media as "an
OL,16,Fattempt to target political enemies and
OL,17,Fweaponize federal law enforcement".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
